Alembic migrations (async). No migrations exist yet: the schema arrives in M2.

Run from apps/api with DATABASE_URL_MIGRATIONS set to the Supabase *session pooler* URL:

    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "short description"

In CI the manual workflow .github/workflows/migrate.yml runs `alembic upgrade head`.
